cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "gnark-gradient-prover: Groth16 proofs of bounded model updates for federated learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mehdi
    family-names: Valinejad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9154-9606"
  - name: "CorpiXo"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CorpiXo/gnark-gradient-prover"
abstract: >-
  A Groth16 proof service (gnark, BN254) for federated learning. A norm
  circuit proves that a model update is bounded; an ElGamal circuit proves that
  encrypted updates are in range and bounded against the encrypted global
  model, binding the proof to the ciphertext the server aggregates. Separate
  prover and verifier roles load pinned keys checked against a manifest.
